  "description": "DEMOLITION OF REDUNDANT/ VACANT BUILDINGS ASSOCIATED WITH FORMER\nHORNCHURCH AMBULANCE STATION AND ERECTION OF 2 PAIRS OF SEMI-DETACHED\nPROPERTIES TOGETHER WITH FRONTAGE PARKING AND PRIVATE/ALLOCATED\nAMENITY SPACE",
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
